## Context

Quality grounding review gap G4: the headline result (DeepSeek V3.2
decomposition, F1=98.8%, 163/163 plants) is based on n=1 run. No
confidence interval, no variance estimate. Other conditions have
n=2–3 replicates with bootstrap CIs. A reviewer will flag the
asymmetry: the best result is the one with no error bar.

## Actions

1. Run 2 additional replicates of the DeepSeek V3.2 decomposition
   sweep (same prompt, same parameters, temperature=0 if possible).
2. Compute bootstrap 95% CI on the 3-run F1.
3. Update the results table and the abstract claim.
4. If F1 varies across runs (temperature>0 or non-deterministic
   sampling), report the range.

## Test

Three runs exist for DeepSeek V3.2 decomposition. Bootstrap CI
computed. Abstract updated with interval.

## Exit criteria

- n≥3 replicates for the headline result
- CI reported in the abstract and results section
- If F1 drops on additional runs, the narrative updated honestly
